# Implementation Plan - Step 3: Modular LLM Integration

Connect VoxVision AI to a real LLM provider via the FastAPI backend and WebSocket architecture, supporting modular LLM services, streaming/loading states, error handling, and zero key exposure to the client.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **API Key Security**: API keys (`GEMINI_API_KEY`, `OPENAI_API_KEY`) will reside exclusively in `backend/.env` and will be loaded server-side by `backend/app/config.py`. Under no circumstances will keys be exposed in frontend JavaScript, WebSocket payloads, or browser client logs.
> **Modular Architecture**: An abstract `LLMService` layer will be implemented in `backend/app/services/llm_service.py`. It supports provider switching via `.env` (`LLM_PROVIDER=gemini` or `openai` or `mock`). If no API key is supplied, it falls back to a graceful mock engine without crashing.
> **UI Design Consistency**: The visual style will strictly adhere to the existing dark developer theme (`#090a0e`, `#11141c`, `#161a26`, `#6366f1`).

